    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Automated syscall fuzzing to find kernel bugs",
      "source_hash": 1410414401179721162,
      "context_hash": 1938317418706022178,
      "translation": "커널 버그를 찾기 위한 자동화된 시스템 콜 퍼징",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bugs": "버그",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422470Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What is syzkaller?",
      "source_hash": 7826788099978552814,
      "context_hash": 9636565516124499478,
      "translation": "syzkaller란 무엇인가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syzkaller": "syzkaller"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422470Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "syzkaller is an automated kernel fuzzer developed by Google.",
      "source_hash": 12749859386845229731,
      "context_hash": 12496290449705184175,
      "translation": "syzkaller는 Google이 개발한 자동화된 커널 퍼저(fuzzer)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Google": "Google",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "syzkaller": "syzkaller"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422470Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It generates random **sequences of syscalls** and executes them in a VM, monitoring for crashes, hangs, memory errors (via KASAN/KCSAN), and other anomalies.",
      "source_hash": 5076829746625831257,
      "context_hash": 7934174385859662159,
      "translation": "syzkaller는 무작위 **시스템 콜 시퀀스**를 생성해 VM에서 실행하며, 크래시, 행(hang), (KASAN/KCSAN을 통한) 메모리 오류 및 기타 이상 동작을 감시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "KASAN": "KASAN",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422470Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Since 2015, syzkaller has found thousands of kernel bugs reported on [syzbot](https://syzkaller.appspot.com).",
      "source_hash": 15841752051588396003,
      "context_hash": 18113942420803554346,
      "translation": "2015년 이후 syzkaller는 [syzbot](https://syzkaller.appspot.com)에 보고된 수천 개의 커널 버그를 찾아냈습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bugs": "버그",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "syzbot": "syzbot",
        "syzkaller": "syzkaller"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422471Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Architecture",
      "source_hash": 3158869230334080673,
      "context_hash": 209561845745514633,
      "translation": "아키텍처",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422471Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "kcov: kernel coverage instrumentation",
      "source_hash": 6657773761332301281,
      "context_hash": 14108192392407811831,
      "translation": "kcov: 커널 커버리지 계측",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422471Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "syzkaller uses **kcov** to guide fuzzing toward new code paths:",
      "source_hash": 7899838168863735265,
      "context_hash": 15107201371268895092,
      "translation": "syzkaller는 **kcov**를 사용해 퍼징이 새로운 코드 경로로 향하도록 유도합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "code path": "코드 경로",
        "syzkaller": "syzkaller"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422471Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Syscall descriptions (syzlang)",
      "source_hash": 1552751938963301303,
      "context_hash": 15538711090723043731,
      "translation": "시스템 콜 기술(syzlang)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422471Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "syzkaller uses a description language (syzlang) to model syscall arguments:",
      "source_hash": 1281447450124915773,
      "context_hash": 9787417597192473632,
      "translation": "syzkaller는 기술 언어(syzlang)를 사용해 시스템 콜 인자를 모델링합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "syzkaller": "syzkaller"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422471Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This allows syzkaller to generate valid-ish syscall sequences rather than completely random bytes.",
      "source_hash": 12495971564580067282,
      "context_hash": 15854797540787905979,
      "translation": "이를 통해 syzkaller는 완전히 무작위인 바이트가 아니라 어느 정도 유효한 시스템 콜 시퀀스를 생성할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "byte": "바이트",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "syzkaller": "syzkaller"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:57.422472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Running syzkaller locally",
